    "filename": "05_Caption_Hook_and_Hashtag_Bank.md",
    "markdown": "# 05 · Caption, Hook & Hashtag Bank\n### Copy-paste library for daily posting\n\nKeep this open while you post. Swap the brackets `[ ]`, keep the hook in the first line, and always end with a CTA.\n\n---\n\n## A. 30 scroll-stopping hooks (first 3 seconds)\nReach lives or dies here. Mix these across the month:\n\n**Curiosity / value**\n1. \"Before you buy silver online, watch this.\"\n2. \"One of these is ₹500. One is ₹5,000. Guess before the end.\"\n3. \"3 rules to stack silver without looking like a Christmas tree.\"\n4. \"Save this — these silver trends are about to be everywhere.\"\n5. \"The detail nobody expects and everybody notices.\"\n\n**Trust / proof**\n6. \"How to spot REAL 925 silver (most people get #3 wrong).\"\n7. \"Your silver isn't ruined — you're cleaning it wrong.\"\n8. \"The real test of silver isn't day 1 — it's month 6.\"\n9. \"Why does our silver cost more than the ₹99 stall? Honest answer.\"\n10. \"Silver turns your skin green? Only if it's fake.\"\n\n**Styling**\n11. \"POV: you own ONE silver chain but need 3 looks.\"\n12. \"Gold with a saree is expected. Silver? Power move.\"\n13. \"Your Independence Day fit is missing one thing.\"\n14. \"POV: your silver finally matches your whole aesthetic.\"\n15. \"Stop wearing your silver the boring way.\"\n\n**Occasion / Rakhi**\n16. \"Stop buying plastic rakhis for the brother who has everything.\"\n17. \"Haven't bought the rakhi yet? You're actually right on time.\"\n18. \"If you want it delivered before Rakhi, watch this.\"\n19. \"Rakhi isn't only brothers — it's the sister who steals your jewellery.\"\n20. \"Last 24 hours to order Rakhi. This is it.\"\n\n**Product / desire**\n21. \"This ₹___ anklet is doing something to outfits.\"\n22. \"We restock this every month and it's gone in days.\"\n23. \"Turn your sound on for this.\" (ASMR)\n24. \"We just dropped the set everyone's been asking for.\"\n25. \"Our #1 bestseller outsold everything 3 to 1 — guess it.\"\n\n**Interactive (comment-drivers)**\n26. \"Comment your birth month, I'll tell you your silver piece.\"\n27. \"Which one would you pick — 1, 2 or 3?\"\n28. \"Tag the sister who needs to see this.\"\n29. \"Dainty or statement? Fight it out in the comments.\"\n30. \"Send me your outfit, I'll pick your silver.\"\n\n---\n\n## B. Caption formula (use every time)\n**[Hook line] → [1–2 lines of story/value] → [proof: 925/hallmark/ships pan-India] → [CTA + question].**\n\nExample:\n> *The most versatile ₹___ you'll spend. One 925 sterling chain → office, dinner, festival, done. Hallmarked, anti-tarnish, ships across India from our Jayanagar house. Which look is you — 1, 2 or 3? 👇*\n\n**Signature sign-offs (rotate for recall):**\n- \"— House of Silver ✦\"\n- \"Real silver. Real shine. Real you.\"\n- \"Worn in Bangalore, loved everywhere.\"\n- \"Everyday luxury you can keep forever.\"\n\n---\n\n## C. CTA lines (rotate — always include one)\n- \"DM 'RAKHI' to order 🎁\" · \"DM 'NEW' for the drop\"\n- \"Save this for later 🔖\" · \"Tag your sister 👭\"\n- \"Link in bio to shop 🛍️\" · \"WhatsApp us to order\"\n- \"Follow the House for daily silver ✦\"\n- \"Comment 👇 and I'll reply with the price\"\n- \"Order by [date] for guaranteed Rakhi delivery\"\n\n---\n\n## D. Hashtag sets (copy a block — use 5–10, not 30)\n\n**Base (every post):**\n`#925silver #silverjewellery #sterlingsilver #bangalorejewellery #jayanagar #diyamhouseofsilver`\n\n**Rakhi / gifting:**\n`#rakhi2026 #rakshabandhan #silverrakhi #rakhigift #giftofsilver #onlinerakhi`\n\n**Styling / trend:**\n`#silverstyling #ootd #stackingrings #anklets #minimalistjewellery #jewellerytrends2026`\n\n**Trust / proof:**\n`#realsilver #hallmarked #925hallmark #silvercare #jewellerytips`\n\n**Local Bangalore:**\n`#bangalore #nammabengaluru #southbangalore #jayanagar #bangaloreshopping #karnataka`\n\n**Occasion (swap in):**\n`#independenceday #15august #madeinindia` · `#festivejewellery #ethnicwear #silverwithsaree`\n\n**Tip:** put 5–8 tightly relevant tags in the caption (they double as SEO keywords), not a wall of 30. Refresh one set weekly with whatever's trending.\n\n---\n\n## E. Story prompts (fill the daily 2–4 stories)\n- Poll: \"Silver or gold? 🤍/💛\" · \"Dainty or statement?\" · \"Which Rakhi set — 1/2?\"\n- Question: \"Ask me anything about 925 silver\" · \"Send your outfit, I'll pick the silver\"\n- Countdown: to Raksha Bandhan (28 Aug) / order cut-off\n- This-or-that: \"Oxidised vs sterling\" · \"Office vs party\"\n- Add Yours: \"Show your silver stack\"\n- Behind-the-scenes: packing, polishing, new stock unboxing, the store\n- Reshare: every customer post + every Reel's best comment\n- Link sticker: website / WhatsApp / Rakhi collection\n\n---\n\n## F. Trending-audio routine (do this daily, 5 min)\n1. Open the **Reels tab**, scroll 10–15 Reels.\n2. Spot the little **↗ arrow** by the audio name = it's trending.\n3. Tap → **\"Save audio.\"**\n4. Keep a running list of 10 saved sounds; match the calendar's \"audio type\" to a saved trend when you film.\n5. Prioritise sounds with a rising (not peaked) use-count. TikTok trends hit Reels ~2 weeks later — scout there for a head start.\n\n---\n*That's the full system. Start at file 00, run file 02 day by day, and review every Sunday.*\n"
